a giant fire ant~
A giant fire ant scurries about its business.
~
Quite larger than the common ant, these creatures breed and spread rapidly
over most types of terrain. A little over one foot long, it has a painful
sting that's poisonous to most species. Alone, it is easily defeated but the
fire ant tends to remain underground and lives in colonies hundred strong.
~
